<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Red Cinder Cone</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:254-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.459953" lon="-121.642952"><ele>897.6</ele><name>Camp Sherman store and post office</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:camp-sherman-store (OSM way 517788725); confidence: high; pdf_page: 256; book_elev_ft: 2960; quote: This is an ideal 6.3-mile ski tour for Novice-Intermediate skiers, measured from the store.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.458640" lon="-121.654460"><ele>907.8</ele><name>Camp Sherman Road at Road 1420</name><desc>source: OSM node 39510294, south end of Forest Road 1420 on SW Camp Sherman Road (NF 1419); confidence: high; pdf_page: 256; quote: Drive north on Road 1420 to the end of plowing</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.507460" lon="-121.654580"><ele>892.9</ele><name>Road 1420 at Road 440</name><desc>source: OSM node 39422354, shared by Forest Road 1420 and Forest Road 440; confidence: high; pdf_page: 256; quote: Ski north on the road past the Canyon Creek Campground road to Road 440 (to the right), which connects with Road 1270</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.513930" lon="-121.656590"><ele>936.0</ele><name>Road 440 at Road 1270</name><desc>source: OSM node 39422384, north end of Forest Road 440 on Forest Road 1270; confidence: high; pdf_page: 256; quote: Road 440 ... connects with Road 1270 and goes to the cinder cone</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.523473" lon="-121.647862"><ele>1028.5</ele><name>Road 1270 at the second quarry road (1270-590)</name><desc>source: OSM node 39550274, east end of Forest Road 1270-590 on 1270; 1270-570 (the first) leaves 280 m earlier; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 257; quote: There are two side roads to the quarry - take the second one</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.521550" lon="-121.651760"><ele>1066.4</ele><name>Road 1270-590 west end</name><desc>source: OSM way 283489366 (Forest Road 1270-590) west end, in the quarry; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 257; quote: ski 0.3 mile to the top of the cinder butte</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.522800" lon="-121.651700"><ele>1100.5</ele><name>Red Cinder Cone top</name><desc>source: DEM high point (3,605 ft) on a 70 m grid; no named summit in OSM; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 257; book_elev_ft: 3610; quote: rises only 650 feet above the flat Metolius valley ... If you ski to the west side, the view sweeps from Green Ridge ... to Jefferson</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Red Cinder Cone</name><desc>1. Camp Sherman store and post office -&gt; Camp Sherman Road at Road 1420: osm (medium), 0.60 mi | 2. Camp Sherman Road at Road 1420 -&gt; Road 1420 at Road 440: osm (high), 3.40 mi | 3. Road 1420 at Road 440 -&gt; Road 440 at Road 1270: osm (high), 0.50 mi | 4. Road 440 at Road 1270 -&gt; Road 1270 at the second quarry road (1270-590): osm (high), 1.00 mi | 5. Road 1270 at the second quarry road (1270-590) -&gt; Road 1270-590 west end: osm (medium), 0.24 mi | 6. Road 1270-590 west end -&gt; Red Cinder Cone top: straight (medium), 0.09 mi</desc>
